"<v2_7_0_migration>` di akhir. Setiap hash commit menautkan ke diff-nya di "
"GitHub."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.7.0.rst:108
msgid ":func:`sensor.set_auto_gain` reworked to dB *(major)*"
msgstr ":func:`sensor.set_auto_gain` dirombak ke dB *(major)*"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.7.0.rst:110
msgid ""
":func:`sensor.set_auto_gain` no longer accepts the integer ``value=`` "
"keyword and no longer returns ``True`` / ``False``. Use "
"``sensor.set_auto_gain(False, gain_db=...)`` (a float dB value), read it "
"back with the new :func:`sensor.get_gain_db`, and wrap the call in ``try`` /"
" ``except`` since failure now raises ``ValueError``."
msgstr ""
":func:`sensor.set_auto_gain` tidak lagi menerima kata kunci integer "
"``value=`` dan tidak lagi mengembalikan ``True`` / ``False``\\ . Gunakan "
"``sensor.set_auto_gain(False, gain_db=...)`` (nilai float dB), baca kembali "
"dengan :func:`sensor.get_gain_db` yang baru, dan bungkus pemanggilan dalam "
"``try`` / ``except`` karena kegagalan kini menampilkan ``ValueError``\\ ."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.7.0.rst:116
msgid ""
"*Commits:* `b906c5f19 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/b906c5f19>`__"
msgstr ""
"*Commit:* `b906c5f19 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/b906c5f19>`__"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.7.0.rst:121
msgid ":func:`sensor.set_auto_exposure` reworked to microseconds *(major)*"
msgstr ":func:`sensor.set_auto_exposure` dirombak ke mikrodetik *(major)*"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.7.0.rst:123
msgid ""
":func:`sensor.set_auto_exposure` no longer accepts the integer ``value=`` "
"keyword and no longer returns ``True`` / ``False``. Use "
"``sensor.set_auto_exposure(False, exposure_us=...)``, read it back with the "
"new :func:`sensor.get_exposure_us`, and handle the ``ValueError`` raised on "
"failure."
msgstr ""
":func:`sensor.set_auto_exposure` tidak lagi menerima kata kunci integer "
"``value=`` dan tidak lagi mengembalikan ``True`` / ``False``\\ . Gunakan "
"``sensor.set_auto_exposure(False, exposure_us=...)``\\ , baca kembali dengan"
" :func:`sensor.get_exposure_us` yang baru, dan tangani ``ValueError`` yang "
"ditampilkan saat kegagalan."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.7.0.rst:129
msgid ""
"*Commits:* `7be0a7a18 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/7be0a7a18>`__"
msgstr ""
"*Commit:* `7be0a7a18 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/7be0a7a18>`__"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.7.0.rst:134
msgid "``find_displacement()`` / FFT framesizes overhauled *(major)*"
msgstr "``find_displacement()`` / ukuran bingkai FFT dirombak *(major)*"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.7.0.rst:136
msgid ""
"Phase-correlation was overhauled. ``image.find_displacement()`` now returns "
"a displacement object (with ``x_translation()`` / ``y_translation()`` — "
"formerly ``x_offset`` / ``y_offset`` — plus ``rotation()`` / ``scale()`` and"
" new ``logpolar`` / ``fix_rotation_scale`` keywords); the separate rot-scale"
" object was removed and ``find_rotscale()`` added. The FFT framesize "
"constants were renamed/removed: ``sensor.B40x30`` was removed entirely, and "
"``sensor.B64x32`` / ``B64x64`` were renamed to uppercase ``sensor.B64X32`` /"
" ``B64X64`` (with new ``B128X64`` / ``B128X128``)."
msgstr ""
"Korelasi fase dirombak. ``image.find_displacement()`` kini mengembalikan "
"objek displacement (dengan ``x_translation()`` / ``y_translation()`` — "
"sebelumnya ``x_offset`` / ``y_offset`` — ditambah ``rotation()`` / "
"``scale()`` dan kata kunci baru ``logpolar`` / ``fix_rotation_scale``\\ ); "
"objek rot-scale terpisah dihapus dan ``find_rotscale()`` ditambahkan. "
"Konstanta ukuran bingkai FFT diubah nama/dihapus: ``sensor.B40x30`` dihapus "
"sepenuhnya, dan ``sensor.B64x32`` / ``B64x64`` diubah nama menjadi huruf "
"besar ``sensor.B64X32`` / ``B64X64`` (dengan ``B128X64`` / ``B128X128`` "
"baru)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.7.0.rst:145
msgid ""
"*Commits:* `c78f91b42 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/c78f91b42>`__, `213396d09 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/213396d09>`__"
msgstr ""
"*Commit:* `c78f91b42 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/c78f91b42>`__\\ , `213396d09 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/213396d09>`__"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.7.0.rst:151
msgid ":func:`sensor.set_auto_whitebal` reworked to dB *(minor)*"
msgstr ":func:`sensor.set_auto_whitebal` dirombak ke dB *(minor)*"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.7.0.rst:153
msgid ""
":func:`sensor.set_auto_whitebal` replaced its integer ``value=[r, g, b]`` "
"keyword with ``rgb_gain_db=[r, g, b]`` (float dB) and now returns ``None`` "
"(raising ``ValueError`` on failure) instead of ``True`` / ``False``. Use the"
" new :func:`sensor.get_rgb_gain_db` to read the gains back."
msgstr ""
":func:`sensor.set_auto_whitebal` mengganti kata kunci integer ``value=[r, g,"
" b]`` dengan ``rgb_gain_db=[r, g, b]`` (float dB) dan kini mengembalikan "
"``None`` (menampilkan ``ValueError`` saat kegagalan) alih-alih ``True`` / "
"``False``\\ . Gunakan :func:`sensor.get_rgb_gain_db` yang baru untuk membaca"
" gain kembali."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.7.0.rst:158
msgid ""
"*Commits:* `30ecbdc4f <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/30ecbdc4f>`__"
msgstr ""
"*Commit:* `30ecbdc4f <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/30ecbdc4f>`__"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.7.0.rst:163
msgid "``set_hmirror()`` / ``set_vflip()`` return ``None`` *(minor)*"
msgstr "``set_hmirror()`` / ``set_vflip()`` mengembalikan ``None`` *(minor)*"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.7.0.rst:165
msgid ""
":func:`sensor.set_hmirror` and :func:`sensor.set_vflip` now return ``None`` "
"and raise ``ValueError`` on failure instead of returning a ``True`` / "
"``False`` status. Remove any code that branches on their return value."
msgstr ""
":func:`sensor.set_hmirror` dan :func:`sensor.set_vflip` kini mengembalikan "
"``None`` dan menampilkan ``ValueError`` saat kegagalan alih-alih "
"mengembalikan status ``True`` / ``False``\\ . Hapus kode apa pun yang "
"bercabang berdasarkan nilai kembaliannya."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.7.0.rst:169
msgid ""
"*Commits:* `aeb023804 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/aeb023804>`__"
msgstr ""
"*Commit:* `aeb023804 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/aeb023804>`__"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.7.0.rst:174
msgid "WINC firmware tools require a file path *(minor)*"
msgstr "Alat firmware WINC memerlukan jalur file *(minor)*"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.7.0.rst:176
msgid ""
":class:`network.WINC` firmware tooling changed: ``wlan.fw_dump()`` / "
"``wlan.fw_update()`` now take a mandatory firmware-file-path argument and "
"the WINC is opened in a programming mode (``network.WINC(mode=...)``). "
"Update no-argument calls to pass a path (e.g. "
"``wlan.fw_update(\"/winc_19_5_2.bin\")``)."
msgstr ""
"Perkakas firmware :class:`network.WINC` berubah: ``wlan.fw_dump()`` / "
"``wlan.fw_update()`` kini memerlukan argumen jalur file firmware yang wajib "
"dan WINC dibuka dalam mode pemrograman (\\ ``network.WINC(mode=...)``\\ ). "
"Perbarui pemanggilan tanpa argumen untuk meneruskan jalur (mis. "
"``wlan.fw_update(\"/winc_19_5_2.bin\")``\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.7.0.rst:182
msgid ""
"*Commits:* `fcc3b0b9c <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/fcc3b0b9c>`__"
msgstr ""
"*Commit:* `fcc3b0b9c <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/fcc3b0b9c>`__"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.7.0.rst:187
msgid "``image.find_number()`` requires a 28x28 ROI *(behavior)*"
msgstr "``image.find_number()`` memerlukan ROI 28x28 *(behavior)*"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.7.0.rst:189
msgid ""
"``image.find_number()`` (LeNet) now requires an exactly 28x28 ROI that fits "
"inside the image and raises an error otherwise (instead of running on an "
"arbitrary/full-image ROI). Pass an explicit ``roi=(x, y, 28, 28)``."
msgstr ""
"``image.find_number()`` (LeNet) kini memerlukan ROI tepat 28x28 yang muat di"
" dalam citra dan menampilkan kesalahan jika tidak (alih-alih berjalan pada "
"ROI sembarang/penuh citra). Berikan ``roi=(x, y, 28, 28)`` secara eksplisit."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.7.0.rst:193
msgid ""
"*Commits:* `4d09a13f3 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/4d09a13f3>`__"
msgstr ""
"*Commit:* `4d09a13f3 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/4d09a13f3>`__"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.7.0.rst:198
msgid "AprilTag ``z_rotation()`` sign flipped *(behavior)*"
msgstr "Tanda ``z_rotation()`` AprilTag dibalik *(behavior)*"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.7.0.rst:200
msgid ""
"The AprilTag ``z_rotation()`` (and related ``rotation()``) now uses a right-"
"handed coordinate convention, so the returned angle is negated versus prior "
"releases. Scripts that depend on the old sign must invert the value or "
"adjust their angle math."
msgstr ""
"``z_rotation()`` AprilTag (dan ``rotation()`` terkait) kini menggunakan "
"konvensi koordinat tangan kanan, sehingga sudut yang dikembalikan dinegasi "
"dibandingkan rilis sebelumnya. Skrip yang bergantung pada tanda lama harus "
"membalik nilainya atau menyesuaikan matematika sudutnya."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.7.0.rst:205
msgid ""
"*Commits:* `7673aaf74 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/7673aaf74>`__"
msgstr ""
"*Commit:* `7673aaf74 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/7673aaf74>`__"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.7.0.rst:210
msgid "Migration checklist"
msgstr "Daftar periksa migrasi"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.7.0.rst:212
msgid "For a clean port to v2.7.0 the typical work is:"
msgstr "Untuk porting bersih ke v2.7.0, pekerjaan tipikal adalah:"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.7.0.rst:214
msgid ""
"Port ``set_auto_gain()`` to ``gain_db=`` + ``get_gain_db()`` and handle "
